:"撮影の帰りにマネージャーさんが、まあや良かったよ！って言ってくれたのが嬉しかった...\nいつものまあやじゃなかったっていってた！でもカメラ向いてない時はもうまあやだったけどって...笑\nでもうれちっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽい感じの服装で、自分でも知らなかった表情の まあやを撮って頂いて、スタッフさんも楽しくしてくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たよ～！って方\n感想聞かせてね\nもう見たよ！って方からコメントあって嬉しかったです\nありがとうございます（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中見てくださいましたかぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんの書記がかり頑張ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漢字勉強頑張ります(^^)あは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーLIVEもうすぐだよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは学校のテスト期間とまるかぶりです\nでも負けないよ！\nコメントや握手会で応援してくれる皆が\nまあやのパワーです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも元気な姿をみせたいよぉんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校と乃木坂との両立を頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験生の皆も頑張ってください‼️\nまあやも夜中まで頑張ってるよ\n一緒に頑張ろうー❗️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントは全部読んでます\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またコメント返しをするね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会では○○○○の服を着る予定だよ～\n一緒に楽しみたいから いろいろ考えたー(o´罒`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も皆が健康で笑顔でありますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/10/12/7733442/0015.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}